I got this.

343
00:16:39,680 --> 00:16:41,580
我需要确定我能放心再把
I need to make sure that I can trust you

344
00:16:41,580 --> 00:16:42,940
我闺蜜的真心交给你
with my best friend's heart again.

345
00:16:43,460 --> 00:16:45,660
天啊 这活脱就是《傲骨贤妻》啊
Oh, my God, that was pure Good Wife.

346
00:16:48,060 --> 00:16:50,160
麦克斯 去苏菲的卡座坐着
Max, go have a seat in Sophie's booth.

347
00:16:50,320 --> 00:16:52,720
没事 但我想来些猪"牌"
That's fine, but I'm getting some of that pork chip.

348
00:16:54,260 --> 00:16:55,260
味道不错 宝贝
It's good, baby.

349
00:16:55,400 --> 00:16:57,520
这道菜还会配有土豆"泥巴"
It comes with a side of ass potatoes.

350
00:17:01,220 --> 00:17:01,720
兰迪
Randy.

351
00:17:02,620 --> 00:17:05,060
你住在洛杉矶 麦克斯住在纽约
You live in L.A. Max lives in New York.

352
00:17:05,760 --> 00:17:08,540
你有没有说过
Did you or did you not say you're bad

353
00:17:08,540 --> 00:17:10,060
你不擅长谈异地恋
at long-distance relationships?

354
00:17:10,540 --> 00:17:11,080
说过
I did.

355
00:17:11,380 --> 00:17:13,360
你有没有说过
And did you or did you not say

356
00:17:13,360 --> 00:17:15,620
你只是来这里待个周末
that you're just in town for the weekend?

357
00:17:15,820 --> 00:17:17,340
这话我的确说过
Well, I did say that--

358
00:17:17,900 --> 00:17:19,280
女士 你有没有看见
Ma'am, do you or do you not see me

359
00:17:19,280 --> 00:17:21,100
我在进行模拟审判呢
conducting a mock trial up in here?

360
00:17:23,140 --> 00:17:26,340
兰迪 你有没有
Randy, did you or did you not

361
00:17:26,340 --> 00:17:29,960
示意一名心理医生来跟麦克斯分手 因为...
break up with Max using a therapist because...

362
00:17:29,960 --> 00:17:32,300
你自己说不出口
you couldn't do it yourself?

363
00:17:35,180 --> 00:17:36,580
-我... -回答我的问题
-Well, I-- -Answer the question!

364
00:17:38,140 --> 00:17:38,500
有
Yes.

365
00:17:39,360 --> 00:17:41,500
卡洛琳 你好牛逼
Caroline, girl, you are good.

366
00:17:42,800 --> 00:17:44,700
当年我因为身为黑人
Where were you when I got arrested

367
00:17:44,700 --> 00:17:46,220
在华盛顿州被捕时 你在哪里
for being black in Tacoma?

368
00:17:48,880 --> 00:17:51,440
你住在洛杉矶 麦克斯住在纽约
You're living in L.A., Max is living in New York,

369
00:17:51,560 --> 00:17:53,020
你们俩都在否认现实
and you're both living in denial

370
00:17:53,020 --> 00:17:54,600
明明这段感情就无法维持
if you think a relationship can work.

371
00:17:55,100 --> 00:17:57,540
我能走近卡座 为自己辩护吗
May I approach the booth and mount my defense?

372
00:17:59,560 --> 00:18:01,840
你昨天进行了三次"高潮"水平的辩护
You mounted the defense three times yesterday.

373
00:18:04,200 --> 00:18:05,800
反对 亲吻证人
Objection! Kissing the witness!

374
00:18:06,460 --> 00:18:08,920
你们在外面搞什么鬼啊
What the hell is going on out here?

375
00:18:09,120 --> 00:18:12,460
他们在审判这个白人版的比利·迪·威廉姆斯
They are putting that white Billy Dee Williams on trial.

376
00:18:15,780 --> 00:18:18,920
你说的没错 我的确伤害了她
You're right, I did hurt her.

377
00:18:20,000 --> 00:18:22,540
示意心理医生跟她提分手 是一个错误的决定
Breaking up with her using a therapist was a bad decision.

378
00:18:22,880 --> 00:18:25,660
跟她分手 本身就是一个错误的决定
Breaking up with her at all was a bad decision.

379
00:18:25,940 --> 00:18:27,680
她为什么要相信我 如果我只是
And why should she trust me if I'm just gonna

380
00:18:27,900 --> 00:18:29,740
来这里待个周末就走了呢
blow into town for the weekend and leave?

381
00:18:30,040 --> 00:18:31,320
你作为一个律师
Well, for a lawyer,

382
00:18:31,320 --> 00:18:33,772
论点貌似是在给自己挖坑跳啊
you're not making a great case for yourself.

383
00:18:33,772 --> 00:18:35,080
对啊
Yeah.

384
00:18:35,080 --> 00:18:37,260
如果我是你的话
I mean, if I were you,

385
00:18:37,260 --> 00:18:39,600
我会立马脱掉我的上衣
I'd just take my shirt off right now.

386
00:18:42,020 --> 00:18:43,860
而真相是
And the truth is...

387
00:18:43,880 --> 00:18:45,620
我不是来这里出差
I'm not here on business.

388
00:18:46,080 --> 00:18:48,141
托尼·班尼特没有告女神卡卡
Tony Bennett isn't suing Lady Gaga.

389
00:18:48,141 --> 00:18:50,380
尽管他该告 但不关我事
Although he should. I'm just not involved.

390
00:18:51,840 --> 00:18:54,000
我这周末来纽约
I came to New York for the weekend

391
00:18:54,000 --> 00:18:55,820
是为了见麦克斯
to see Max.

392
00:18:56,900 --> 00:18:58,800
她也是我要留在纽约
And she's the reason I'm gonna stay

393
00:18:58,800 --> 00:19:00,160
整整一个月的原因
in New York for a month

394
00:19:00,160 --> 00:19:02,140
看看这段感情能不能够继续
to see if we can make this work.

395
00:19:03,600 --> 00:19:06,660
我觉得那算是两个加分点
I think that should count as two pros.

396
00:19:10,640 --> 00:19:12,480
你真的会为我留在这里吗
You're really gonna stay here for me?

397
00:19:12,820 --> 00:19:14,720
我总是情不自禁想你
I couldn't stop thinking about you.

398
00:19:15,160 --> 00:19:17,400
我甚至没有删掉手机里你的照片
I didn't even delete your photos off my phone.

399
00:19:18,451 --> 00:19:21,237
你也太丢人了吧
Well, that's pathetic.

400
00:19:24,920 --> 00:19:27,700
我找到了超适合你们甜点吧的地方
So I think I found the perfect space for your dessert bar.

401
00:19:28,160 --> 00:19:30,300
肯定比你之前带我们去看的那"地洞"好吧
It's got to be better than the other holes you showed us.

402
00:19:30,420 --> 00:19:32,500
它处于威廉斯堡最潮的地方
Well, it's in the trendiest part of Williamsburg,

403
00:19:32,520 --> 00:19:35,360
租金便宜 房东是一个非常好的人
cheap, and the landlord is a really nice guy.

404
00:19:35,360 --> 00:19:37,320
这里离餐厅好近
It's so close to the diner.

405
00:19:37,660 --> 00:19:39,220
如果撞到阿憨 会不会很尴尬啊
Won't it be weird if we run into Han?

406
00:19:39,220 --> 00:19:40,420
我是指不是用车撞的时候
And not with a car?

407
00:19:42,300 --> 00:19:43,200
好了 就是这里
Okay. This is it.

408
00:19:43,800 --> 00:19:44,360
你们好呀
Hello!

409
00:19:45,340 --> 00:19:47,200
靠 我讨厌木偶戏
Oh, no, I hate puppet shows.

410
00:19:49,000 --> 00:19:51,420
依薇 这不行 这是小蛋糕店
Evie, this isn't available, it's a cupcake shop.

411
00:19:51,540 --> 00:19:53,520
除非那两个女孩终于放弃 但那是不可能滴
Unless those two girls finally gave up.

412
00:19:54,400 --> 00:19:56,520
我决定让你俩扩张
I've decided to let you expand.

413
00:19:56,740 --> 00:19:59,960
依薇说服我走出舒适区 做一些不同的事情
Evie convinced me to do things outside my comfort zone.

414
00:20:01,520 --> 00:20:02,633
没错
Yes, I did.

415
00:20:02,633 --> 00:20:04,320
你看看 卡洛琳
How 'bout that, Caroline?

416
00:20:04,320 --> 00:20:07,160
除了我们 她还给别人看了肮脏的黑"地洞"
We're not the only ones she showed a dingy, dark hole to.

417
00:20:08,320 --> 00:20:10,180
收起你的淫秽思想
Get your minds out of the gutter.

418
00:20:10,280 --> 00:20:11,660
她是带我去做热瑜伽
She took me to hot yoga.

419
00:20:12,180 --> 00:20:14,100
他唱颂两下他就吐了
He vomited two "oms" in.

420
00:20:14,600 --> 00:20:16,100
但至少他敢于尝试
But at least he tried.

421
00:20:16,600 --> 00:20:18,120
所以谁知道接下来会试什么呢
So who knows what's next?

422
00:20:18,600 --> 00:20:20,280
我从来没吃过龙虾
Well, I've never had lobster.

423
00:20:21,420 --> 00:20:22,480
阿憨 你确定要这么做吗
Han, are you sure about this?

424
00:20:22,560 --> 00:20:24,340
让我们在这里开甜点吧
You'll let us build our dessert bar here?

425
00:20:24,680 --> 00:20:27,220
我确定我应该马上就会后悔
I'm sure I'll regret it almost immediately.

426
00:20:28,340 --> 00:20:29,700
阿憨 虽然我现在很想抱你
Han, I would hug you right now,

427
00:20:29,700 --> 00:20:31,300
但弊大于利
but the cons outweigh the pros.

428
00:20:32,480 --> 00:20:34,400
这肯定会成为最酷的酒吧
This is gonna be the coolest bar!

429
00:20:34,500 --> 00:20:35,820
我们只需把这玩意弄走
We just have to get rid of that.
